    Suggest 4-5 high-yield Android application ideas that function as "Automated Wealth Assets". 
    Focus on apps that run themselves and scale revenue with zero marginal cost.

    CRITICAL: For each idea, include a "Compliance Framework" that ensures the automation remains within legal and ethical boundaries (Privacy, IP, Terms of Service).

    For each idea, provide a detailed JSON object.
  `;

  const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
    model: "gemini-3-pro-preview",
    contents: prompt,
    config: {
      thinkingConfig: { thinkingBudget: 32768 },
      responseMimeType: "application/json",
      responseSchema: {
        type: Type.ARRAY,
        items: {
          type: Type.OBJECT,
          properties: {
