               </div>
            </div>
            <div className="max-w-2xl">
              <h2 className="text-6xl font-black text-white mb-6 tracking-tighter uppercase leading-none italic">Build Wealth.</h2>
              <p className="text-slate-400 text-xl leading-relaxed font-medium">The Construction Governor converts code matrix snippets into fully-realized automated wealth assets. Initialize your build core to synthesize architectural guiders.</p>
            </div>
            <button 
